f=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:37714d57-99b1-44a9-bf36-b85478a1de83\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:37714d57-99b1-44a9-bf36-b85478a1de83\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarhun_Mnemonis\" title=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/25px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/38px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/50px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/25px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tarhun_Mnemonis\" title=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\">Tarhun Mnemonis</a> only if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> was freed during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, causing the estate to be haunted.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>At <a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\">Lady Jannath's</a> request, all domestic staff are to leave premises and consider themselves on temporary leave until recalled.\n</p><p><br>\nNo imputation of malfeasance should be inferred from this - in light of recent events, our lady simply wants a little time to herself. \n</p><p><br>\nDuring this leave, staff will be paid half wages, are free to seek other temporary employment.\n</p><p><br>\n-Chamberlain Mercer\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234323\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33000/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8706/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936292/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.913      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.913      1 -total\n 58.60%   22.803      9 Template:Icon_text\n 50.65%   19.709     21 Template:Trim\n 19.16%    7.4